noPhotos

# anti-B0 -> D_s+ anti-K0 mu- nu (PHSP), isospin partner of Bplus/DsKmunu. See
# decfiles/cocktail/B0/DsKenu/decay.dec for the isospin-assignment reference. BR fixed to 0
# in this cocktail component (see config.yaml) -- included for categorization/gap-accounting
# completeness, not as an SM contribution.

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B0sig  anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
1.0  D_s+   anti-K0  mu-  anti-nu_mu   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

End
